# This directory should contain application icons:
# - icon.ico (Windows)
# - icon.icns (macOS)
# - icon.png (Linux)

# You can generate these from a 1024x1024 PNG using various online tools
# or install the electron-icon-builder package:
# npm install --save-dev electron-icon-builder
# npx electron-icon-builder --input=icon.png --output=build